From 22a550e5acb566ad1109ca29af72315f07d56364 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gili Tzabari <cowwoc2020@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 09:34:55 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Resume available parents when V2 subagents finish

A child's completion or failure now starts a turn on an idle parent, unless the parent was interrupted, and the spawn guidance tells the model it may finish its turn while delegated work keeps running. The stable unleashed_background_subagents feature, enabled by default, controls both; disabling it keeps queue-only completion mail.
